    "body": "@linnea-lin-00638949 could you please update PR's description:\r\n\r\n> he exception is not caught by the EngineCore busy loop, so it propagates as EngineDeadError and tears down all workers — the API server exits and subsequent requests get connection refused.\r\n\r\nvLLM has recently got support for handling exceptions in structured output in [scheduler](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/main/vllm/v1/core/sched/scheduler.py#L2876-L2884). So, now it does not tear down all workers.\r\n\r\nAlso, please fix pre-commit issues.",
